BoxUI contains RendererAdapter.
RendererAdapter provides MaterializedPresentation.
RendererAdapter status proposed.
RendererAdapter cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
RendererAdapter owns ReconcileViewNodes.
ReconcileViewNodes realizes MaterializedPresentation.
ReconcileViewNodes specifies "Trusted allow-listed kind/action registry; stable view/plot IDs, incremental updates and local DOM/native handles only.".
RendererAdapter owns EmitBoundUserIntent.
EmitBoundUserIntent realizes MaterializedPresentation.
EmitBoundUserIntent specifies "Translate interaction through typed Presentation binding; no APT parsing, business authority or direct service bypass.".
RendererAdapter owns ObserveRenderedRevision.
ObserveRenderedRevision realizes MaterializedPresentation.
ObserveRenderedRevision specifies "Report actual display/failure separately from schema publication; headless observation is not pixels/accessibility evidence.".
